        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Logging only is the default. Enabling the preset replaces the running override using a bounded copy of your selection. Changes apply to future sessions. The original preset is unchanged. Review its settings in Adjustments; a percentage is not a hard cap on insulin delivered."
